                  <msItem>
                     <title source="2587">Decreta pontificum</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes" source="2587">MSS. 6, 22, 97, 101 have a common form of
                        inscription, s. xv, consisting of the title and secundo folio linked by the
                        words "et incipit in 2o folio".</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes" source="2587">Earlier at Exeter, q. v.</note>
                  <title source="2693">Ps. Isidorus</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes" source="2693">Measures 17" x 12"¾ and has 370 leaves; the
                        table of contents header in large capitals, 'Incipit breviarium Canonum
                        apostolorum comes on fol. 4v.</note>
                     <msItem source="2693">
                        <author>Ps. Isidorus (Isidorus Mercator)</author>
                        <title>Collectio canonum</title>
                     </msItem>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
               <history>
